and Pļaviņš lost a later match. Rego and Ricardo had no such problems, winning all their pool matches easily. Dalhausser and Rogers made it to the semis, and easily defeated the Georgian pair of " [:a {:href "/athletes/112525"} "Geor"] "/" [:a {:href "/athletes/112535"} "Gia"] " (you read that correctly – they were Brazilian émigrés who had been recruited to play for Georgia). Rego and Ricardo faced their countrymen, " [:a {:href "/athletes/112546"} "Fabio"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/106789"} "Marcio"] ", and were beaten in two close sets. The final saw Rogers and Dalhausser win a closely fought first set, 23-21, but Fabio and Marcio came back to win the second set, 21-17. But that was it. In the deciding set, Rogers and Dalhausser trounced the Brazilians, 15-4, to win the gold medal."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button443426", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button443426').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Matches Played"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Wins"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Losses"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Sets"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Faults"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Aces"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Fastest Serve"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Attack Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Attack Successes"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Block Successes"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Opponent Errors"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Dig Successes"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {: